v 3
d ctools: C-accelerated tools for Stata
d
d ctools provides high-performance C plugins for Stata that dramatically
d accelerate common data operations through parallelization and optimized
d algorithms.
d
d Included commands:
d   csort       - Parallel sorting (IPS4o, radix, timsort, etc.)
d   cmerge      - C-accelerated dataset merging
d   cimport     - Multi-threaded delimited text and XLSX import
d   cexport     - Delimited text and XLSX export
d   creghdfe    - HDFE regression with CG solver
d   civreghdfe  - IV/2SLS regression with HDFE
d   cqreg       - Quantile regression with IPM solver
d   cbinscatter - Binned scatter plots
d   cencode/cdecode - Convert value labels
d   cdestring   - Convert strings to numeric data
d   csample/cbsample - Sampling and bootstrap draws
d   cwinsor     - Winsorize or trim variables
d   crangestat  - Range statistics
d   cpsmatch    - Propensity score matching (ATT)
d   cpplmhdfe   - PPML with high-dimensional fixed effects
d
d Version: 1.0.2
d
d Requires: Stata 14.1 or later
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260920

